= Constitutional Court largely upholds Book Six

The Constitutional Court has rejected the attempt to full strike down Catalonia's new law of contracts and it surprisingly has accepted most of Book Six. However, it has indeed ruled against some of its newest provisions, anulling some of its newest provisions. At least, the completed code and almost all of its practical effects survive.

